    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d306">

                <pb facs="0450" n="436" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg436"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.00/12–745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Argentina</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-08T13:00:00-05:00">December 8, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1746. Urtel 3062 Dec 7.<anchor n="72" xml:id="d306-f1"/> Full details and
                    documentary proof (if discreetly obtainable) of plans developed in Police Dept
                    for systemized anti-Semitic campaign of violence would be extremely useful in
                    preparation of our case here. Please telegraph whether these data are likely to
                    become available with reasonable promptness.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
